    "Helper 等附屬程序的流量會算在所屬的 App 上。選「僅 App」時，系統服務與指令列工具合併顯示為「其他程序」。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Traffic from helper processes is counted toward the app they belong to. With “Apps Only”, system services and command-line tools are grouped as “Other Processes”."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Helper 等附屬程序的流量會算在所屬的 App 上。選「僅 App」時，系統服務與指令列工具合併顯示為「其他程序」。"
