    "以協商的 %@ A 滿載時，路徑上約損失 %@ W。依 %lld 筆負載變化估算（擬合度 %@），包含線材、兩端接頭與充電器；同一個充電器換線比較才有意義。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "At the full negotiated %@ A, about %@ W is lost along the path. Estimated from %lld readings at different loads (fit %@). Includes the cable, both connectors and the charger — compare cables on the same charger."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "以協商的 %@ A 滿載時，路徑上約損失 %@ W。依 %lld 筆負載變化估算（擬合度 %@），包含線材、兩端接頭與充電器；同一個充電器換線比較才有意義。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
