    "使用電池且電量降到門檻時開啟低耗電模式；接上電源後，會關閉由這個功能開啟的低耗電模式。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Turns on Low Power Mode when running on battery and the charge drops to the threshold. When you plug in, Low Power Mode is turned off if this feature turned it on."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用電池且電量降到門檻時開啟低耗電模式；接上電源後，會關閉由這個功能開啟的低耗電模式。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "使用電池時，電量每降到一個選取的百分比就提醒一次；接上電源後重新計算。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "On battery, you’re alerted once each time the charge drops to a selected level. Resets when you plug in."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用電池時，電量每降到一個選取的百分比就提醒一次；接上電源後重新計算。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
