        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "充電器最高可供 %lld W。MagSafe 線材不提供線材規格。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "充電器最高可供 %lld W。有多個連接埠正在使用，各埠的線材規格請看「連接埠」分頁。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The charger can supply up to %lld W. Several ports are in use; see the Ports tab for each port’s cable."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "充電器最高可供 %lld W。有多個連接埠正在使用，各埠的線材規格請看「連接埠」分頁。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "充電器最高可供 %lld W。這條線材沒有 e‑marker 晶片（或目前讀不到），依規格最高承載 3 A（60 W）。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The charger supplies up to %lld W. This cable has no e‑marker chip (or it can’t be read), so it’s limited to 3 A (60 W) by spec."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "充電器最高可供 %lld W。這條線材沒有 e‑marker 晶片（或目前讀不到），依規格最高承載 3 A（60 W）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
