    "充電器正在為電池充電。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The charger is charging the battery."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "充電器正在為電池充電。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "充電器目前提供的電力不夠系統使用，或沒有實際供電。改用瓦數更高的充電器，或檢查線材與插頭。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The charger isn’t supplying enough power for the system, or isn’t supplying any. Try a higher-wattage charger, or check the cable and plugs."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "充電器目前提供的電力不夠系統使用，或沒有實際供電。改用瓦數更高的充電器，或檢查線材與插頭。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "充電器與線材": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Charger & Cable"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "充電器與線材"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "充電器與線材搭配良好：充電器最高可供 %lld W，線材額定可承載 %lld W。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Charger and cable are a good match: the charger supplies up to %lld W and the cable is rated for %lld W."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "充電器與線材搭配良好：充電器最高可供 %lld W，線材額定可承載 %lld W。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "充電器與線材都正常。macOS 暫停了充電，通常是已到「充電上限」，或「最佳化電池充電」正在延後充到 100%；Mac 仍使用充電器的電力。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The charger and cable are fine. macOS has paused charging, usually because the charge limit was reached or Optimized Battery Charging is holding off on 100%. Your Mac still runs on the charger."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "充電器與線材都正常。macOS 暫停了充電，通常是已到「充電上限」，或「最佳化電池充電」正在延後充到 100%；Mac 仍使用充電器的電力。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
