    "列出充電器宣告的所有檔位（包含 PPS 與 EPR 高功率檔位），並標出 Mac 實際談妥的電壓與電流。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lists every power level your charger offers (including PPS and high-power EPR levels) and marks the voltage and current your Mac actually negotiated."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
