    "按「開始掃描」計算各資料夾的大小並找出大型檔案。第一次掃描「桌面」「文件」「下載項目」時，系統會詢問是否允許 MyNetBatt 存取；MyNetBatt 只讀取檔案大小，不讀取內容。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Click “Start Scan” to measure each folder and find large files. The first time Desktop, Documents and Downloads are scanned, macOS asks whether MyNetBatt may access them. MyNetBatt reads file sizes only, never contents."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按「開始掃描」計算各資料夾的大小並找出大型檔案。第一次掃描「桌面」「文件」「下載項目」時，系統會詢問是否允許 MyNetBatt 存取；MyNetBatt 只讀取檔案大小，不讀取內容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "按一下後輸入組合鍵（需包含 ⌘、⌥ 或 ⌃）；按 Esc 取消。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Click, then press a key combination (must include ⌘, ⌥ or ⌃). Press Esc to cancel."
