          }
        }
      }
    },
    "比對螢幕支援的最佳解析度與更新率；沒跑到最佳時，說明是設定、連線頻寬，還是 USB 資料佔用了影像通道。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Compares your display’s best resolution and refresh rate with what it’s running. If it’s not at its best, it explains whether it’s a setting, link bandwidth, or USB data using the video lanes."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "比對螢幕支援的最佳解析度與更新率；沒跑到最佳時，說明是設定、連線頻寬，還是 USB 資料佔用了影像通道。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
