    "線材沒有 e‑marker 晶片或目前讀不到（基本線材最高 3 A／60 W）": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The cable has no e‑marker chip or it can’t be read (basic cables are limited to 3 A / 60 W)"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "線材沒有 e‑marker 晶片或目前讀不到（基本線材最高 3 A／60 W）"
