    "線材識別碼": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cable ID"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "線材識別碼"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "線材資訊來自線材內的 e‑marker 晶片；沒有晶片的基本線材、MagSafe 線讀不到規格。插拔後幾秒內會自動更新。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cable details come from the cable’s e‑marker chip; basic cables without one and MagSafe cables don’t report a rating. Updates a few seconds after you plug or unplug."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "線材資訊來自線材內的 e‑marker 晶片；沒有晶片的基本線材、MagSafe 線讀不到規格。插拔後幾秒內會自動更新。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "線材限制了充電速度：充電器最高可供 %lld W，但這條線材額定只能承載 %lld W，換一條線可以充得更快。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The cable is limiting charging speed: the charger supplies up to %lld W, but this cable is only rated for %lld W. A different cable will charge faster."
          }
        },
