    "點一下選單列的網路或電池圖示會打開小視窗；更多資訊在「監控中心」。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Click the network or battery icon in the menu bar to open its popover. There’s more in the dashboard."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "點一下選單列的網路或電池圖示會打開小視窗；更多資訊在「監控中心」。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "點擊會顯示各連接埠的連線速度、線材規格與充電狀態；有連接埠被線材限速時，圖示會出現橘色圓點。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Click to see each port’s link speed, cable rating and charging status. An orange dot appears when a cable is limiting a port."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "點擊會顯示各連接埠的連線速度、線材規格與充電狀態；有連接埠被線材限速時，圖示會出現橘色圓點。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "點擊這些項目會打開監控中心的「系統效能」頁。": {
